{"id":"msg_m_ex_lifeagain_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_lifeagain","label":"Rehabilitation Room · Group"},"label":"4. Rumani has invited Nadia to join the group.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_lifeagain_03","next":null,"speakers":{"rumani":"Rumani","folkwang":"Folkwang","epinel":"Epinel","nadia":"Nadia"},"icons":{"rumani":"si_c240_00_s","folkwang":"si_c242_00_s","epinel":"si_c241_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_lifeagain_04_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 106020112 · After Rehabilitation Room chat 3. I can't thank you all enough.","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_1","text":"Rumani has invited Nadia to join the group.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_2","text":"I invited you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_3","text":"Nadia?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"folkwang","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_4","text":"Wow, Nadia!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"epinel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_5","text":"Hello.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_6","text":"Hi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_7","text":"You guys had a group chat this whole time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_8","text":"You haven't been bad-mouthin' me in here, have you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_9","text":"What are you doing in this group chat?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_10","text":"What? Am I not allowed to join?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_11","text":"That's not what I meant.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_12","text":"Nadia suddenly asked if we had a group chat","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_13","text":"and then requested to be added because she had something to say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_14","text":"Oh, it's not much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_15","text":"I just wanted to let you all know that I got first place in the track and field competition today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_16","text":"No way! You got first place?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_17","text":"Guess you missed it, huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_18","text":"I was in the lead","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_19","text":"from start to finish.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_20","text":"No one overtook me even once the entire time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_21","text":"Amazing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_22","text":"I know, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"epinel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_23","text":"You're incredible, Nadia.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"folkwang","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_24","text":"I knew you had it in you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"folkwang","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_25","text":"You've got what it takes, and I'm confident you'll end up surpassing even me one day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_26","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_27","text":"That's my dream!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"folkwang","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_28","text":"Haha, I'm sure you can do it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_29","text":"I'll certainly try!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_30","text":"I promise I didn't join this chat just to brag though, haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_31","text":"I wanted to say thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_32","text":"If it weren't for all of you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_33","text":"I wouldn't have been able to achieve my dream.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_34","text":"In a way,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_35","text":"you all helped me make a fresh start.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_36","text":"So I wanted to say thanks again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_37","text":"I'm not very good with words,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_38","text":"so I can't really think of much else to say other than that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_39","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_40","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_41","text":"thank you so much!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_42","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_42","text":"No one responds to Nadia's messages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_43","text":"What's going on?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_44","text":"Why isn't anyone responding?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_lifeagain_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"folkwang","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_lifeagain_04_45","text":"Oh boy...","jum